Stage 5E.4.1 live contractual DPD schema migration gate.
The workflow runner must install migration 0034 only on a main push.
The migration must not create any live contract schedules, installments, or allocations.
Existing loan statuses, collection transactions, historical ECL outcome labels, and journal entries must remain unchanged.
Default classification, ECL, account 1190, and General Ledger posting remain disabled.
